# ---- Local data & runtime artifacts ----
# Anchored to the repository root. Unanchored, `storage/` matched
# apps/api/src/.../core/storage/ and silently kept a whole package out of a
# commit — git status does not list ignored files, so nothing said so.
*.db
*.sqlite3
.data/
/storage/
/uploads/
logs/
*.log

